193: \item \textbf{Simulated Thermal Annealing Demagnetization (V74)}: implemented Method B (linear sweep with decaying simulated thermal annealing white noise torque) as an alternative pre-treatment demagnetization protocol, and introduced the temperature scaling parameter \code{--demag\_temp};
