196: \item \textbf{Total Wall-Clock Execution Time (V77)}: introduced high-precision wall-clock timing monitoring of the entire execution from script invocation to final output, printing the final elapsed execution time as ``Completed in XXXX.XX sec'' with two decimal digits.
